---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ButtonLink from '../components/ButtonLink.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affordable Website Design in Albany, NY"
  description="Affordable custom website design for small businesses in Albany, Troy, and beyond. Bring a comparable independent designer’s written website production quote and Calypso Digital Studio will beat it."
>
  <header class="intro container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Affordable web design · Albany, NY and beyond</p>
    <h1>Affordable website design, without cutting the parts your business needs.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Looking for a low-cost website designer for your small business? Calypso Digital Studio builds websites around an agreed scope and offers a <strong>price-beat guarantee on comparable independent website production quotes</strong>.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <ButtonLink href="/start">Request a Website Quote</ButtonLink>
      <ButtonLink href="/work" variant="secondary">See Our Work</ButtonLink>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="promise container surface" aria-labelledby="promise-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Website production price-beat guarantee</p>
    <h2 id="promise-title">Found a lower quote? We'll beat the production price.</h2>
    <p>Show us a <strong>current, verifiable, written quote</strong> from another independent web designer. If the quoted website design and build work covers an equivalent scope, we'll provide a lower price for that same production work.</p>
    <p>This is more than price matching. It's a commitment to beat a qualifying competitor's <em>website production price</em>, not a claim that every type of website can be built for the same amount.</p>
    <p class="fineprint">The guarantee excludes domain registration, web hosting, subscriptions, ongoing maintenance, other third-party charges, and separately commissioned custom software. See the <a href="/services#price-guarantee">full price-beat terms</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content container" aria-labelledby="what-you-pay-for">
    <p class="eyebrow">Straightforward website quotes</p>
    <h2 id="what-you-pay-for">What affects the cost of a small-business website?</h2>
    <p>A simple informational website generally requires less production work than an online store or a custom booking workflow. The goal is to quote the work you actually need instead of bundling unnecessary features into your build.</p>
    <div class="factors">
      <article>
        <h3>Pages and content</h3>
        <p>How many unique pages are needed? Are your photos and copy ready, or do they need to be organized and produced?</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Design and revisions</h3>
        <p>A focused design direction is different from a larger branding project. We'll define the design deliverables and agreed revision scope up front.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Functionality</h3>
        <p>Forms, bookings, payment integrations, e-commerce, and specialized tools can affect production time. We'll distinguish essential functions from optional additions.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Launch and ownership</h3>
        <p>Your quote should explain deployment, handoff, and any costs that continue after launch, rather than mixing production fees into unrelated subscriptions.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content container" aria-labelledby="compare-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Compare like for like</p>
    <h2 id="compare-title">How we beat an independent web design quote</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><strong>Share the quote.</strong> Provide a current written, itemized quote for website design and production from an independent designer.</li>
      <li><strong>Confirm the scope.</strong> We compare pages, functionality, deliverables, revision terms, and launch responsibilities. Prices for different scopes are not equivalent.</li>
      <li><strong>Get a lower production quote.</strong> If the project qualifies, we'll quote below the competitor's website production amount with the agreed comparable scope in writing.</li>
    </ol>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/services#price-guarantee">Read the full price-beat policy</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="content container" aria-labelledby="answers-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Questions worth asking</p>
    <h2 id="answers-title">Affordable website design FAQs</h2>
    <div class="questions">
      <article>
        <h3>How much does a cheap small-business website cost?</h3>
        <p>It depends on page count, design work, content readiness, and features. We don't advertise a single starting price that implies every business needs the same website. <a href="/start">Tell us what you need</a> and we'll quote the production scope.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Can you beat another website designer's price?</h3>
        <p>Yes, for qualifying, comparable website production quoted in writing by another independent web designer. We compare the actual work and beat the quoted production amount, not hosting or third-party charges.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Is a cheap website builder the same as hiring a designer?</h3>
        <p>No. Do-it-yourself builders usually charge for a platform and require you to create and manage the site. A designer charges for producing the agreed website. Compare the build, ongoing platform fees, and responsibilities separately.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Do you only work with businesses in Albany?</h3>
        <p>No. We're based in New York's Capital Region, serving businesses around Albany and Troy as well as clients elsewhere. Work can be discussed and delivered remotely.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact container surface">
    <p class="eyebrow">Ready for a straightforward quote?</p>
    <h2>Tell us what you're building, and what you've been quoted.</h2>
    <p>We'll help define a practical website production scope and review a competing written quote when you have one.</p>
    <ButtonLink href="/start">Start Your Project</ButtonLink>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {padding-block:var(--space-8);max-width:min(calc(100% - 2rem),var(--container))}
  .intro h1 {max-width:20ch}
  .lede {font-size:var(--step-1)}
  .actions {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-3);margin-top:var(--space-5)}
  .promise {padding:var(--space-6);margin-bottom:var(--space-8)}
  .promise h2 {max-width:25ch}
  .fineprint {font-size:var(--step--1)}
  .content {padding-block:var(--space-6)}
  .content h2 {max-width:26ch}
  .factors,.questions {display:grid;gap:var(--space-4);margin-top:var(--space-6)}
  .factors article,.questions article {border-top:2px solid var(--color-ink);padding-block:var(--space-4)}
  .factors article p,.questions article p {margin-bottom:0}
  .steps {display:grid;gap:var(--space-3);max-width:70ch;padding-left:1.5rem}
  .steps li {padding-left:var(--space-2)}
  .contact {padding:var(--space-6);margin-block:var(--space-7)}
  @media(min-width:48rem) {
    .factors,.questions {grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
    .promise,.contact {padding:var(--space-7)}
  }
</style>
